window.products.push({"id":902143,"name":"BYVOV 3pc Anti-Scratch Nylon Kitchen Utensils Set - Slotted Spatula, Cooking Spoons & Slotted Spoon -Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Zne4ggwUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High Quality Nylon Utensils Set - Made of premium nylon material,this nylon cooking utensils designed not to bend, break or rust.Safe for use with any type of food, does not react with food or beverages, you don’t have to worry about the health of your families. Heat Resistant, Non-Scratch - Unlike traditional kitchen utensils, our cooking utensil sets can withstand temperatures up to 446°F/230°C.The nylon head of kitchen spatula set protect your pans, keep the cookware surface not scratched or dented. Ergonomically Designed Handle - The soft, flexible handle with finger mold feels comfortable and strong to hold, prevents heat transfer, so you don’t have to worry about scalding the chef’s hands. Perfect help for people suffering from arthritis in the hands. This cooking set is a great gift choice for mom or anyone who loves to cook. Easy to Clean and Hang - One-piece molding makes cleaning easier, there are no gaps to catch food, and no seams to ensure no water stays. Kitchen spatula set has hanging holes for easy storage. Great Companion in the kitchen - The slotted serving spoon is ideal for draining water from cooked food before serving. The heat-resistant nature of the cooking spoon makes it ideal for stirring hot soups and sauces while cooking on the stove top.Use slotted spatula to fry eggs, flip chocolate cakes, cakes, omelets, biscuits, pancakes, crepes, pies, fish, quiche or use as a sieve to allow excess fat to drip off.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Zne4ggwUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BYVOV","source_asin":"B09FXG4V29","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FXG4V29","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FXG4V29","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":902144,"name":"LAWOHO Christmas Tree Topper Star, Jeweled Crown with 60 Warm White LED USB Lighted Tree Topper, Xmas Tree Decor with Remote Control 8 Lighting Mode, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K7XnQsW+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【2022 Upgraded Version】The Christmas tree topper uses crown shape design, shell color is silver. With clear beads and 60 fairy LED warm white lights, the lighting position is uniform, and the same brightness of the light can be seen in each position. There is a circle of tiny diamonds inlaid at the bottom, with crowning glory. The spiral base makes it stronger and stable on the top of the Christmas tree. 【Compatible with Most Christmas Trees】Our crown tree topper has a width and length of about 8.7 inch and a height of 7.5 inch, which is the standard size for Christmas tree topper. The 6.6ft USB interface cable also makes the treetop star easy to connect. This glowing crown tree decoration makes your Christmas tree look like a queen, and the unique crown shape highlights the noble and gorgeous temperament. 【USB Power Supply and Remote Control】This jewelry crown tree topper has a USB port instead of battery operated. The function button is on the USB plug for easy operation. You can control the LED lighting mode by the function button or the 13-key remote. The remote control has 8 lighting modes, 10 level brightness adjustment, timer function (after 6 hours of light, shutdown for 18 hours, 24 hours of automatic cycle). 【Holiday and Daily Decoration】 Different from other Christmas tree top decorations, our LED Christmas tree top decoration can not only be used as a Xmas tree decor, but also a desktop decoration. You can use it as Christmas, Valentine's Day, Thanksgiving, Easter, birthday, wedding, baptism, party and other holiday decorations. Placed in your living room, bedroom, fireplace, children's room and beauty room, to bring good luck to the family. Warm fairy lights light up every memorable day in your life. 【Best New Year Gift】The top DIY crafts Christmas gifts and indoor Xmas tree decorations. The remote control controls 8 lighting designs that will satisfy the curiosity of all members of the family, especially children. This jewelry crown Christmas tree topper is definitely the finishing touch to your Christmas home decoration. Buying it back will amaze your family, lover, and friends and you will receive a lot of appreciation!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81K7XnQsW+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAWOHO","source_asin":"B0BPSHV1QL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902144","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPSHV1QL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPSHV1QL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
