window.products.push({"id":902207,"name":"SIDIANBAN Small Bathroom Trash Can with Bamboo Lid Soft Close and Foot Pedal, 1.3Gal/5L Round Garbage Can with Removable Inner Wastebasket for Bedroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":36.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lrm8kuWuL._SL1001_.jpg","description":"CAPACITY AND SIZE: 1.3 Gallon / 5Liter; Height: 9.8inches / 25cm; Diameter: 8inches / 20.5cm; Inner wastebasket size Height: 8inches / 20.5cm; Diameter: 7.6inches / 19.5cm. Please check the product size. Please make sure it is the size is what you need before purchasing. NATURAL BAMBOO LID: The lid of the trash can is made of natural and environmentally friendly bamboo, and each lid has a unique bamboo pattern. The natural bamboo style can be fully integrated with different home environments. The small garbage can with a bamboo lid can hide unsightly garbage and keep the home clean and tidy. SOFT CLOSE LID: The small trash can uses damper slowdown technology, the lid can be lowered slowly, and the lid can be closed quietly to avoid strong collision between the lid and the barrel and at the same time avoid making noisy noise. You don’t need to worry about disturbing the rest of your family when using it. STRONG PEDALS: The sturdy steel pedal is very easy to use, and when you step on it lightly, the trash can lid opens. The combination of steel pedals and plastic provides wear resistance and durability. The trash can with pedals allows you to dispose of trash without having to lift the lid by hand, so your hands will not get dirty. REMOVABLE INNER BUCKET: The trash can has a durable plastic liner bucket, and the inner bucket has a stainless steel handle. You can easily lift the inner bucket, dump the trash, and rinse quickly when needed. STYLISH BARREL DESIGN: The body of the trash can is made of iron material, can be used for a long time, not easy to rust. With a thickened non-slip base and stainless steel handle, it is more convenient to use. SPACE SAVING: The small trash can with a compact design is perfect for small spaces such as a bathroom, bedroom, living room, office, kid room, powder room, RVs, college dorm rooms, etc. You can put the trash can under the table or next to the sofa or any place with limited space. EASY TO CLEAN: The surface is smooth and easy to clean and can be quickly wiped off with a damp cloth. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: If the trash can you received is damaged or you're not completely happy with your purchase, please contact us for a new replacement or refund your money.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41lrm8kuWuL._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SIDIANBAN","source_asin":"B09CTDQKZ4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902207","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CTDQKZ4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CTDQKZ4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
