window.products.push({"id":902216,"name":"Hand Made Baltic Amber Mandala Art Decoration, Home Decor Souvenir, Gemstone Vitrage of Life (Two Kittens)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GoYcFTlrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Give yourself the gift of beauty & joy with our stunning Amber souvenir! Baltic amber vitrage may be a powerful addition to your feng shui ornament collection and transforming element of your living space. What makes our amber gemstone mandala of life stand out? - Made with real natural Baltic amber stone. Comes with our authenticity certificate affirming the amber’s origin. - Unique detailing that makes for a one-of-a-kind amber decor piece About Baltic amber stones Amber stone found in Baltic countries is known as “Nordic gold”. A prized resin formed about 50 million years ago from coniferous trees, Nordic amber has been used time immemorial to create ceremonial pieces such as the amber glass vase or amber necklace for women. Just a couple of purported benefits of amber stone: - Symbolizes happiness and wellbeing and is a wonderful reminder of the joys of life - Warms up any space its placed in thanks to its natural rainbow of colors from light honey to deep dark cherry - Clear amber may create stunning shades under natural sunlight or under your home lighting - Can induce a sense of peacefulness and calm, and help you ward off negative energy Sizing Specifications: 4.33 in diameter plywood base. Please note: Each amber souvenir home decor piece is handcrafted from unique stones that may vary in shape, color, size, texture, amount and may slightly differ from the pictures. Treat yourself to a wonderful happiness amber article by scrolling back up & clicking Add to Basket now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81GoYcFTlrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08XK3C3H6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XK3C3H6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XK3C3H6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
