window.products.push({"id":902282,"name":"Jieqier One-Piece Table Cover and Table Skirt for Rectangle Tables, 6FT Spandex Fitted Tablecloth with Ruffles Skirt for Weddings, Banquets, Baby Show","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51B52tD2bJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One-Piece Design - No need to buy tablecloths and skirts separately, no need to worry about the color matching of tablecloths and table skirts, what you need is just our One-Piece Design table covers. The table cover can fit snugly to the whole table with an elegant pleated skirt of its thoughtful design and stretchy fabric. The 6 ft tablecloth fits tables that are 72\"L X 30\"W X 30\"H. Simple and Fast Setup - No velcro, clips, or fasteners are required. Just stretch the tablecloth over the table, the table skirt will naturally cover the whole table due to the elastic function of spandex, the tablecloth will fit closely with the table and will not be messy even in the wind. The table skirt comes down to the floor classy looking and it can hide all the items under the table that need to be hidden. Wrinkle-Resistant Spandex - Jieqier table cover and skirt were made from 10% Spandex, and 90% Polyester material with a 200 GSM, which makes the tablecloth more stretchable and durable, wrinkle-free, and stain-resistant. It is a durable and absolutely reusable table cloth. Wash it and it will look like new every time you use it for any occasion or event. Perfect for Most Occasions - Multi-purpose applications for indoors and outdoor. Suitable for wedding receptions, trade shows, banquets, buffets, birthday parties, baby showers, holiday parties, restaurant services, craft fair displays, jewelry shows displays, dessert displays, and more. Beautiful ruffles that turn any table into a total showstopper. Easy Care - Machine washable with water (cold temperature) in a gentle cycle. Do not bleach. Low-temperature drying. More durable than disposable table skirts and remain reusable after washing. Due to the long time shipping,some wrinkling can occur, it's normal. Just use the washer for a short time washing, or ironing them gently.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51B52tD2bJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jieqier","source_asin":"B0B8Z6LH9Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8Z6LH9Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8Z6LH9Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
