window.products.push({"id":902338,"name":"Mixology Bartender Kit with Wooden Stand - Great Housewarming Gift -12 Piece Bar Tools Set with Cocktail Kit Cards - Premium Bartending Kit for a Fun ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817mfuSlRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HOME BARTENDER ESSENTIALS: This leak-proof ROYALE MIX cocktail shaker set for drink mixing includes every essential bar tool (12 pieces) for year-round cocktail making plus a hand-crafted rustic wood stand to organize them in style. Create professional-level liquor cocktails with confidence - regardless of whether you’re a seasoned bartender or a beginner. Trendy house warming gift for new home. A COCKTAIL LOVER’S DREAM GIFT: High-end drink mixer shaker set outfitted with a beautiful wooden holder that has everything they’ll need to set-up a well-appointed home bar and craft their favorite cocktails. These bar essentials come in an attractive magnetic gift box to make for an unforgettable present they’ll love. ORGANIZE YOUR BARWARE THE OLD FASHIONED WAY: A home bar accessories set inspired by 20th century rustic-style whiskey crates, and re-innovated to create a bartending kit that organizes all of your bar tools to always have them ready for mixing cocktails! Spend time enjoying your delicious hand-crafted cocktails instead of searching for the right tools in a cluttered drawer. PREMIUM QUALITY AND EASY TO CLEAN: This finely made cocktail shaker set is manufactured with rustproof stainless steel (SS304 & SS430) and solid acacia wood. Feel at ease putting the stainless steel bar supplies tools in the dishwasher *but make sure to hand wash the ergonomic and all natural acacia wood muddler.* GUARANTEED SATISFACTION OR YOUR MONEY BACK! We are proud of the quality of our martini kit and we know you’ll be happy with it. This is why we back it with 100% Money Back Guarantee and an extended 3-year warranty, to help you buy and mix drinks with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817mfuSlRuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROYALE MIX","source_asin":"B09Z68JN7R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902338","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z68JN7R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z68JN7R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
