window.products.push({"id":902356,"name":"ARLIME 3-In-1 Stand Mixer, 7 Qt. 800 W 6-Speed & Pulse Tilt-Head Food Mixer W/Stainless Steel Bowl, Dough Hook, Whisk Mixing , Beater Juicer & Meat Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":146.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TKHNUIioL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥖7QT. MIXING BOWL & SPLASH GUARD: The Mixing Bowl with a handle is made from 304 stainless steel which ensures food safety and can perfectly meet all your kitchen needs for a family of 3-7 people. The Removable Splash Guard with a large feeding port is a good helper for you to add ingredients without making a mess. 🥗660W MOTOR & 6-SPEED CONTROL: Arlime Stand Mixer features 660W high-performance motor and 6 adjustable speeds range of low and high speeds handles a variety of recipes and baking needs, ranging from pizza to ice cream, bread to mashed potato, access to multipurpose and a variety of recipes, the preferred stand mixer for kitchen baking lovers. What's more, the stand mixer got an ETL certification, and it also has overheating and overload protection to ensure long-term use. 🍰3-IN-1 KITCHEN HELPER: Arlime Multifunctional Household Stand Mixer comes with A Dough Hook for heavy, dense mixtures at the speed of 1-3, A Beater & A Flex Edge Beater for stirring at 2-4 medium speed, A Whisk for egg mixing at 5-6 high speed. In addition, Arlime 3-In-1 Upgraded Stand Mixer features a 1.5L Juicer Cup & Meat Grinder Accessories, which can satisfy most of your daily use & free your hand. Turn your stand mixer into a culinary center with over 10 available attachments！ 🥝TILT-HEAD & ANTI-SLIP DESIGN: The tilt-head design allows access to install or uninstall mixing bowl and accessories easily and is also more convenient to add ingredients during the mixing process. The stand mixer will automatically stop working to ensure safety when tilting up the head. 4 bottom suction cups and a weight of 18.6 lbs ensure the standing mixers firmly suck on the countertop when it works. The noise when the machine is working is less than 76 DB, extremely quiet. 🍕EASY TO USE & CLEAN: Just press the tilt button to put the mixing bowl and install the accessories, then clockwise rotate the bowl to lock and adjust the speed control knob to work; and you can via the Blue LED Indicator to see the dough mixer's works status. The ABS Housing, Stainless Steel and Teflon Coated Aluminum materials enable the machine easy to clean.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TKHNUIioL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARLIME","source_asin":"B09C1S5YNP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C1S5YNP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C1S5YNP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
