window.products.push({"id":902383,"name":"Pmnianhua Wall Mounted Wine Rack with Glass Door,31'' Floating Racks with Stemware Hanger,Wine Display Storage Holder for Kitchen Dining Room Bar(Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SkGY8fjkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍷【 Stylish and Space-Saving Design】:Our wall mounted wine rack features a sleek and minimalist design that adds a touch of modern elegance to any space. The clean lines and white finish effortlessly complement various interior styles, from contemporary to farmhouse. Its compact size makes it an ideal choice for small apartments, kitchens, or dining rooms where space is limited. 🍷【 Easy Installation】:Setting up our Wall Mounted wine glass rack is a breeze. The package includes all the necessary mounting hardware labeled board and detailed instructions, making it a hassle-free installation process. Within minutes, you'll have your wine collection beautifully displayed and organized, ready to impress your guests. 🍷【 Glass Door for Enhanced Visibility】:The wall mounted wine glass rack is designed with a transparent glass door that allows you to showcase your wine collection with pride. The clear glass offers unobstructed views of your favorite bottles, enabling you to select the perfect wine for any occasion. The door also helps protect your wines from dust, ensuring they remain in pristine condition. 🍷【Convenient Stemware Hangers】:To complete the wine aficionado experience, our hanging wine rack is equipped with convenient stemware hangers. Hang your wine glasses upside down to prevent dust accumulation and showcase them alongside your cherished wine bottles. The stemware hangers provide easy access to your glasses, making it effortless to pour and enjoy your favorite wine. 🍷【 Water-Resistant & Scratch-Resistant】: With water-resistant and scratch-resistant finish make the wine glass rack is durable that can be used for a long time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SkGY8fjkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pmnianhua","source_asin":"B09VNQJ62V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902383","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09VNQJ62V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09VNQJ62V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
