window.products.push({"id":902414,"name":"OSP Home Furnishings Rio Mesh Back Office Chair with Arms, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Tx1ZfRCoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rio Office Chair by Ave Six features a white virgin polypropylene frame, one touch pneumatic seat height adjustment with locking tilt control and a heavy duty chrome base.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Tx1ZfRCoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OSP Home Furnishings","source_asin":"B009470W3U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902414","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009470W3U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009470W3U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":902415,"name":"Jumbl™ French Fry Cutter with Dual Fry Size Blades – Potato Dicer Produces Skinny or Large Fry Cuts in a Matter of Seconds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+2wXUGJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The easiest way to cut French fries. Let’s rephrase that: The absolute easiest way to cut French fries. What once involved extensive knife work (and potential carpal tunnel) can now be accomplished in a matter of seconds. Measuring in at a humble 6.5 by 4 inches, this Jumbl French fry cutter is capable of turning your average potato into evenly sized fry strips with a single press. You simply place it directly atop the grid-style blade, and use the press cover to drive the potato through the stainless steel cutters. The result? Smooth, even, perfect French fries. Choose Skinny or Large fry cut size. Serving pizza one night and steak the other? You may want to cut your fries to match. Good thing, then, that the Jumbl French fry cutter includes two interchangeable blades. The blade sizes, Skinny and Large, are engraved on their sides, and each one is built as a complete component – that means no adjusting or loose pieces. Swapping out blades is quick and easy: grab the side tabs, lift the installed blade off the clear base, and install the other blade. Both also work great for preparing fruit, vegetable and cheese sticks. High quality, dishwasher-safe plastics. Included in the box are the following pieces: a press cover, a pusher disc that sits inside the press cover, a Skinny cutting blade, a Large cutting blade, a clear container base, and a bottom cover. All are made of 100% food-safe and dishwasher-safe plastic. The Jumbl French fry cutter ships assembled, and all components come apart for easy cleaning. The bottom cover can be opened to pour the collected fries into the fryer. It also enables you to put the non-installed blade into the clear base for compact storage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+2wXUGJaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jumbl","source_asin":"B00VAHYNF0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902415","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VAHYNF0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VAHYNF0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
