window.products.push({"id":902439,"name":"Octaville Cute Mechnical Kitchen Timer Creative Coffee Machine Style Timer Reminder Kitchen Restaurant Tools 60 Minutes Time (Coffee, green)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-CWR1OR0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"warning!!! 1,If there is no sound,Turn it clockwise to 60, then turn counter-clockwise to the number of minutes you required. A bell will ring at thescheduled time. 2,Due to the principle of mechanical structure, this product will continue to tick for a period of time after the end of operation, which belongs to normal condition. It only needs to wait for a moment to stop the sound. 3,Due to the different manual measurement methods, the size of the data, such as 1-4 cm error is a normal range. 4,There may be a little color difference because of the contrast between the light and the equipment and the display of screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51-CWR1OR0L._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Octaville","source_asin":"B08JMDF7FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JMDF7FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JMDF7FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":902440,"name":"Cotton Area Rug Traditional Tribal Floor Entryway Mat Carpet Rug for Kitchen Living Room Bedroom Block Printed Handwoven Decorative Indoor Home Decor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O8LGUJIRL._AC_.jpg","description":"Namaste!! We at India Ethnicity bring the real India to the world through handcrafted products that are cherished Globally. What’s more rewarding than an Artisan crafting a unique artifact, and in return, receive a platform to craft their own way of life.The hand woven mat in earthen hues carrying floral patterns is a work of art. The mixed cotton-jute mat, dyed using natural colors, is woven in traditional practices followed by the weavers of Kutch in Gujarat, a state in western India. This collection evokes the timeless style of old-world artisans, expertly crafted in India. Combining traditional styling with contemporary colors makes this carpet a good choice for any household. It also comes in beautiful jute bag which can be re used.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51O8LGUJIRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"STORE INDYA","source_asin":"B01M3TAFVZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902440","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M3TAFVZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M3TAFVZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":902441,"name":"Muscle Rack 60 Inch 5 Tier Boltless Steel Shelving Storage Unit with 500 Pound Shelf Capacity for Garages, Pantries, and Basements, Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+sLe6FTnL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Get any room in your home or office organized with the 60-Inch 5 Tier Boltless Adjustable Blue Steel Shelving Storage Unit from Muscle Rack. This storage rack features an open-air, steel wire design that promotes air circulation to help prevent dust buildup and water pooling, keeping all your items clean and dry. Fully customizable, this shelf can be assembled as (1) 60-inch unit, or into (2) 30-inch shelves for a storage space that best fits you. Each of the 5 shelves can be adjusted up or down in 1.5-inch increments and has a 500-pound capacity to accommodate larger or taller items you may want to place on the shelves. The boltless design allows you to quickly and easily assemble this storage shelf with minimal tools and hardware. Easily organize pantries, garages, basements, or anywhere else in your home with the Boltless Adjustable Blue Steel Shelving Storage Unit from Muscle Rack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+sLe6FTnL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Muscle Rack","source_asin":"B07YM8RLW8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902441","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YM8RLW8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YM8RLW8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":902442,"name":"NOVICA Metallic Metal Planes Trains and Autos Sculpture, 6.5\" Tall, Rustic Bulldozer'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WacKDvpFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOVICA, in association with National Geographic, works together with talented artisan designers around the world to produce stunning, keepsake treasures. Our mantra is to spread global happiness, so rest assured - we’ll do everything we possibly can to ensure you’re a happy customer. About this item: With its blade at the ready, a bulldozer roars into action. Armando Ramirez transforms castoff auto parts as well as pieces from a die machine into art. Cogwheels, bearings, screws and points from a motor all find a place in this powerful machine. Its rustic complexity is fascinating. Ramirez does not give his sculptures a fine polished finish, therefore smudges and scratches may be present. - Each work is unique. Recycled parts will vary from piece to piece based on availability. - Features a rustic, rugged finish About our Artist: Born in a Mexican town famed for its traditional artistry, Armando Ramirez dreamed of creating something new. 'As a child I enjoyed inventing toys, and soon yearned to create a unique style of art. Environmentally enamored, I now transform recycled goods. I began to craft figures from scrap and discarded mechanical parts, mostly from cars and bicycles. Thanks to the creativity that God gave me, today I have an enjoyable and better way of life. '","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81WacKDvpFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NOVICA","source_asin":"B01J292MEG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902442","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J292MEG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J292MEG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
