window.products.push({"id":902784,"name":"MERRYBOX Under Sink Organizers and Storage, Sliding Under Cabinet Bathroom Organizer, 2 Tier Kitchen Under Sink Shelf Organizer Pull Out Drawer with H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8169BRoUUhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Space-saving Sliding Pull-out Drawer] MERRYBOX under sink organizers and storage adopts a sliding pull-out design, which is convenient for accessing cleaning supplies. 2 tier under sink rack maximizes makes full use of the limited cabinet space, stores various bottles effectively, makes the kitchen more neater and orderly. [Stable and Strong Load-bearing Capacity] The under sink organizer basket is composed of thick plastic material and stainless steel tubes, which enhance the shelf's durability and load-bearing capacity. The bottom drawer is equipped with 4 non-slip feet pads, which further strengthen the structure of the shelf. The steel pipe coated black can prevent rust, will not crack due to long-term placement in a humid place. [Use in Multiple Scene] The under-sink organizers and storage not only be used in the bathroom or under the cabinet to place toiletries, but it can also be placed on the kitchen countertop to store seasoning jars, placed in the study or bedroom as a bookshelf or makeup storage box, and can even be placed any corners are used as decorations to place plastic plant pots. [Easy to Assemble and Clean] Quickly and easily assemble the 2-tier under sink organizers in 2 minutes, with no tools required. Take care to press the 4 steel pipes firmly into the hole slots to avoid instability issues. The under sink storage with a hollow design for good drainage, and will not hide dirt, only need to wipe the surface with a damp cloth to clean it, saving time and effort. [Accessories for Different Needs and After-sale Guarantee] 4 steel pipes of every bathroom organizer basket enhance the durability of the shelf, and 4 feet pads reinforce the stability. An additional hanging cup to hold toothbrush, toothpaste, comb, and so on. Also equipped with enough functional hooks for hanging rags, bath balls and easy-to-pull handle. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us, we will provide you with 24 hours online service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8169BRoUUhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MERRYBOX","source_asin":"B0BTVD6T4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902784","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTVD6T4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTVD6T4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
