window.products.push({"id":902786,"name":"Kitchen Academy Induction Cookware Sets - 15 Piece Hammered Cooking Pan Set, Granite Nonstick Pots and Pans Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gp7k8erjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🔥 Granite Cookware Set 15 piece - Exhibits an exterior of hammered look, beautiful and luxuriant appearance. Still look brand new even after daily use for seveal year. Include 8-inch fry pan / 9.65-inch fry pan / 1.5-quart saucepan / 3-quart saucepan / 5-quart casserole / 9.45-inch SS round steamer / 8.65-inch SS Round Fry Basket / 5pcs nylon kitchen utensils / 3 lids both fit for pots and pans 🔥 Nonstick Pots and Pans Set - Completely nonstick both inside and outside. When buying cookware, one of the important things is nonstick capabilities. The graniteware coating do a good job in preventing food from sticking. Also, you’ll be able to cook healthier meals for your family since you won’t have to use as much oil. You can safely cook tomato sauce in granite cookware cookware, the taste and smell of your food will not change even if you use acidic or strong-smelling ingredients 🔥 Toxin-free Cooking Set - When buying a new set, make sure that it clearly indicates that it is lead, PFOA, and PFOS-free. These are the three things that you don’t want to have in your cookware because of their potential health dangers. Fortunately, you can get granite cookware that are free of these harmful chemicals 🔥 Induction Cookware Sets - When it comes to the interior, this cookware uses an aluminum core. The result is that the pan heats up quickly, and more importantly, distributes heat evenly. The cookware set works on all major types of cooktops, even induction. Sear meat, braise, or even use it as a wok for frying rice. Dishwasher Safe & Oven safe. Super easy to clean & hand wash recommend! 🔥 Great Quality & Service - Quality first, Service Utmost. All cookware sets purchased have a 365 Days warranty as standard. If you meet any problems, don't hesitate to contact our 24/7 online customer service which will reply to you ASAP to help with your worries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Gp7k8erjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITCHEN ACADEMY BETTER LIVING THROUGH COOKING PERFECTION","source_asin":"B0C5XJKB39","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5XJKB39","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5XJKB39","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":902787,"name":"Nearly Natural 23in. King Protea Artificial Flower (Set of 4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":46.61,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QAQDOgrhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Showcase Mother Nature’s intricate beauty with the help of this loose set of 23” artificial flowers; each stem boasts a single king protea blossom, intricately designed with its native artichoke-like detailing and highlighted with complementary green foliage. Arranged individually or as a collection, this set of four is perfect for creating your own stunning flower arrangement without the need for upkeep. Silk picks are manufactured using synthetic materials, such as polyester material or plastic, and are well designed and constructed to be life-like in appearance. This item will need to be re-shaped when removed from the secure box to allow it to reach its fullest size. Your artificial plant stem will look beautiful for years to come; simply wipe clean with a soft dry cloth when needed. About Nearly Natural Inc. - For over 75 years, Nearly Natural Inc. has been providing conscientious consumers with beautiful alternatives to natural decorations. Employing and advised by naturalists who understand the live plant world, Nearly Natural is able to recreate the most realistic-looking decorative items for homes, offices, and businesses. Driven by a true commitment to customer service, attention to detail, and natural philosophy, Nearly Natural strives to bring customers the most beautiful, unique, and striking faux plants and floral on the market. MATERIALS: Iron Wire, Polyester Materials, PE, PVC","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QAQDOgrhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nearly Natural","source_asin":"B08TQ5LHN4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902787","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TQ5LHN4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TQ5LHN4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
