window.products.push({"id":902893,"name":"Cuticle Trimmer Set ,Nail Cuticle Pusher and Cutter, 1/2 Jaw Stainless Steel Cuticle Nippers Nail Cutter Cutter Kit, Professional Nail Polish Peeler S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JYXukXW1L._AC_.jpg","description":"Do you have such troubles that too much dead skin or cuticle on hands? Do you wanna a pair of smooth and delicate hands? So it's very important to have a good nail polish tools set. Cuticle trimmer with cuticle pusher, you will enjoy a nail treatment for the hangnails and toenails at home or in a nail salon. * Professional small Cuticle Trimmer Sharp cuticle nipper for cutting cuticles and dead skin even in small areas around nails with clean snip without pulling. * Double-ended Nail Cuticle Pusher and cutter Flat head: push down cuticles around nails or remove the polish gel residue; Curved head: cut or scrape away dead cuticle. * Nail Clippers The sharp blade allows you to clip fingernails and thick toenails with minimal effort, the cutting edge will not tear nails. * Nail Lifter It can easily lift the ingrown nails from nail bed to grab debris or dirty inside nails. *Nail Buffer This nail file is designed with 7 sides different level of grit which allows you can just one nail file to buffer and shine your fingernails and toenails. *Cuticle Cleaning Brush This tool is perfect for removing the dust of nail or acrylic tips from hand and foot. *Toe separators This soft and flexible toe separator is a functional tool for keeping toes and fingers apart when applying nail polish or doing nail art. Package Included: 1 x Cuticle Trimmer 1 x Nail Cuticle Pusher 1 x Nail Cuticle Clipper 1 x Ingrown Nail Lifter 1 x Nail Buffer 1 x Nail Cleaning Brush 2 x Toe Separators NOTICE: 1. Be careful when using these sharp tools. 2. Please cover the plastic protective cap after using cuticle scissors and keep them away from your children in case getting hurt. 3. Please use alcohol to wipe stainless steel cuticle remover tools, but don't soak them in the barricade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JYXukXW1L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JUTTIRA","source_asin":"B08B3SWLMW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-902893","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08B3SWLMW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08B3SWLMW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
